  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;IBANAG LANGUAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LANGUAGE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ibanag language is spoken by up to 500,000 speakers, primarily by the Ibanag people in the northeastern provinces of Isabela and Cagayan, and by overseas immigrants in the Middle East, UK, and the US. It is closely related to Gaddang, Itawis, Agta, Atta, Yogad, and Isneg."</data>
